    "subtitle": "From the Act of the small barons to section 63 of the 2000 Act: what each statute did for the baronage, with a link to the record",
    "description": "A reference table of the Acts that shaped the Scottish baronage — 1428, 1455, 1567, 1587, 1592, 1672, 1707, 1746, 1874, 1964 and 2000 — with what each did and a link to the record.",
